</div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32818,31278,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32818, 31278, 5)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Elf</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ship Captain</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.40<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 10, 2008<br/>Winter Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230820200952&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Karith_a09ddc.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Karith.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In the harbour of <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>, in a ship one floor up.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Strangely, unlike most other elven NPCs in-game, Karith does not respond when greeted or said good bye to in elven (with <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Ashari</span> and <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Asha Thrazi</span>, respectively). It can be assumed, by his presence as the only elf in Yalahar, that he was raised there and never learned to speak his own people's language.\n</p><p>After finishing <a href=\"#/quest/in-service-of-yalahar-quest\">In Service of Yalahar Quest</a>, <i>Searoutes around Yalahar</i> mission, he will allow players to travel to:\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Passage to</th>\n<th>Cost (gp)</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">160</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">230</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">185</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">210</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">275</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">260</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">200</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">185</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><small>Completing the Postman Quest gives 10 gp discount to most destinations.</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["between-the-lines-quest","bloody-tusks-quest","feaster-of-souls-quest","illuminator-outfits-quest","in-service-of-yalahar-quest","poltergeist-outfits-quest","revenant-outfits-quest","shadows-of-yalahar-quest","the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest","top-of-the-city-quest","yalaharian-outfits-quest"],"pos":{"x":32818,"y":31278,"z":5}}